the failure that looked like success" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#2E1416;strokeColor=#F87171;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="320" width="770" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="ADR-004 · editable install + boot-time check

